      "adj": "interesting",
      "desc": "You open the copy of 'Cooking: A Modern Approach (3rd Ed.)' and start reading:\n\nRecipe #1\n---------\nGather all following ingredients and follow the directions to prepare this tasty meal.\n\nIngredients:\n  red apple\n  salt\n  yellow potato\n\nDirections:\n  dice the red apple\n  roast the red apple\n  grill the yellow potato\n  prepare meal\n",
